C%5Cpartition-table.bin%20%5E%5Cn%20%20%20%200xd000%20build%5C%5Cota_data_initial.bin%20%5E%5Cn%20%20%20%200x10000%20build%5C%5Csrmodels%5C%5Csrmodels.bin%20%5E%5Cn%20%20%20%200x100000%20build%5C%5Cxiaozhi.bin%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H5ss2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EXU09%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"9de6d284\" id=\"9de6d284\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1fd09850\" id=\"u1fd09850\">命令参数说明</span></strong></h3><ol list=\"u55f5e788\"><li fid=\"u673c300a\" data-lake-id=\"u0710c06c\" id=\"u0710c06c\"><code data-lake-id=\"u306c93c6\" id=\"u306c93c6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc1dd7b8e\" id=\"uc1dd7b8e\">--chip esp32s3</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2c24b59c\" id=\"u2c24b59c\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u27764934\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ucb985c95\" data-lake-id=\"u8496ed25\" id=\"u8496ed25\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebb41828\" id=\"uebb41828\">指定目标芯片为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4e015a23\" id=\"u4e015a23\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub80d4fac\" id=\"ub80d4fac\">ESP32-S3</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0bc34f58\" id=\"u0bc34f58\">。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u55f5e788\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u673c300a\" data-lake-id=\"u89e74ee2\" id=\"u89e74ee2\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua2eca3f2\" id=\"ua2eca3f2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udf27b91b\" id=\"udf27b91b\">merge_bin</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u411976a8\" id=\"u411976a8\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u83fbbded\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u28571ae5\" data-lake-id=\"u9b056937\" id=\"u9b056937\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ae5baa1\" id=\"u9ae5baa1\">使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5d886799\" id=\"u5d886799\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2e9bf06\" id=\"ub2e9bf06\">esptool.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u32ef4e0c\" id=\"u32ef4e0c\"> 的合并功能。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u55f5e788\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u673c300a\" data-lake-id=\"uffca8088\" id=\"uffca8088\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue448fdb9\" id=\"ue448fdb9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u12489bab\" id=\"u12489bab\">--output merged_firmware.bin</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u87fd6457\" id=\"u87fd6457\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ue48aa7d5\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uf3807a09\" data-lake-id=\"ua83102fe\" id=\"ua83102fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9dff696a\" id=\"u9dff696a\">输出合并后的单一 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5c82895d\" id=\"u5c82895d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub201fdba\" id=\"ub201fdba\">.bin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u401cea7e\" id=\"u401cea7e\"> 文件，命名为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u87cf53e8\" id=\"u87cf53e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea8de7e2\" id=\"uea8de7e2\">merged_firmware.bin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u51a69fc5\" id=\"u51a69fc5\">。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u55f5e788\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"u673c300a\" data-lake-id=\"ube73609a\" id=\"ube73609a\"><code data-lake-id=\"uf0131559\" id=\"uf0131559\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1cbcfe88\" id=\"u1cbcfe88\">--flash_mode dio</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua2c026a6\" id=\"ua2c026a6\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u48ac6192\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uabd3328d\" data-lake-id=\"ub7da4ed3\" id=\"ub7da4ed3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u047dad29\" id=\"u047dad29\">指定 Flash 模式为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5999fb96\" id=\"u5999fb96\"><span data-lake-id=\"u089d787d\" id=\"u089d787d\">DIO</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u96415450\" id=\"u96415450\">（双线模式）。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u55f5e788\" start=\"5\"><li fid=\"u673c300a\" data-lake-id=\"u1db5b437\" id=\"u1db5b437\"><code data-lake-id=\"uba1aaa47\" id=\"uba1aaa47\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u063672ac\" id=\"u063672ac\">--flash_size 16MB</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u44afde4c\" id=\"u44afde4c\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u6e4af1c8\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uec41d8ca\" data-lake-id=\"u1a5c9cc4\" id=\"u1a5c9cc4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6df6dfe1\" id=\"u6df6dfe1\">指定 Flash 大小为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub5633412\" id=\"ub5633412\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3113d6f\" id=\"ud3113d6f\">16MB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u602b0ca9\" id=\"u602b0ca9\">。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u55f5e788\" start=\"6\"><li fid=\"u673c300a\" data-lake-id=\"ufb7fae31\" id=\"ufb7fae31\"><code data-lake-id=\"u067963be\" id=\"u067963be\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua63ebdd8\" id=\"ua63ebdd8\">--flash_freq 80m</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucaab312d\" id=\"ucaab312d\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ufac3e968\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6c91c324\" data-lake-id=\"ufa659247\" id=\"ufa659247\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaca9d40c\" id=\"uaca9d40c\">指定 Flash 频率为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4f5792fb\" id=\"u4f5792fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0f36fa9\" id=\"uc0f36fa9\">80MHz</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u309c6e4c\" id=\"u309c6e4c\">。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u55f5e788\" start=\"7\"><li fid=\"u673c300a\" data-lake-id=\"u4a5ed216\" id=\"u4a5ed216\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u60d91f28\" id=\"u60d91f28\">地址和文件列表</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9a8db8ac\" id=\"u9a8db8ac\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u78d80258\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc4a83f19\" data-lake-id=\"u09ab69e5\" id=\"u09ab69e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0e806c18\" id=\"u0e806c18\">每个文件后面都跟上其对应的烧录地址：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u78d80258\" data-lake-indent=\"2\"><li fid=\"ub53ea400\" data-lake-id=\"ue28e0fd7\" id=\"ue28e0fd7\"><code data-lake-id=\"u34a9f445\" id=\"u34a9f445\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19b99c2c\" id=\"u19b99c2c\">0x0 build\\bootloader\\bootloader.bin</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub53ea400\" data-lake-id=\"ue7ef05d7\" id=\"ue7ef05d7\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud7b8d1b3\" id=\"ud7b8d1b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e1bc8f2\" id=\"u2e1bc8f2\">0x8000 build\\partition_table\\partition-table.bin</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub53ea400\" data-lake-id=\"u1f7856ff\" id=\"u1f7856ff\"><code data-lake-id=\"ufd43c9da\" id=\"ufd43c9da\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40dbc934\" id=\"u40dbc934\">0xd000 build\\ota_data_initial.bin</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub53ea400\" data-lake-id=\"u75efc510\" id=\"u75efc510\"><code data-lake-id=\"uea13ca17\" id=\"uea13ca17\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4bd957fe\" id=\"u4bd957fe\">0x10000 build\\srmodels\\srmodels.bin</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub53ea400\" data-lake-id=\"ue5e53db0\" id=\"ue5e53db0\"><code data-lake-id=\"u52b53bcd\" id=\"u52b53bcd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8988436b\" id=\"u8988436b\">0x100000 build\\xiaozhi.bin</span></code></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QpCFc%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"XPHZJ\" id=\"XPHZJ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1f241c1e\" id=\"u1f241c1e\">输出结果</span></strong></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u8bdfc4c1\" id=\"u8bdfc4c1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea9b1ede\" id=\"uea9b1ede\">执行上述命令后，会生成一个名为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ueea87cff\" id=\"ueea87cff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2d68517\" id=\"ub2d68517\">merged_firmware.bin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u049f052d\" id=\"u049f052d\"> 的文件。这个文件包含了所有输入 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u28c861bd\" id=\"u28c861bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81ce86d3\" id=\"u81ce86d3\">.bin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u303ed7bb\" id=\"u303ed7bb\"> 文件的内容，并按照指定的地址偏移进行了合并。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SuQiy%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"YElhR\" id=\"YElhR\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc7b973fe\" id=\"uc7b973fe\">烧录合并后的文件</span></strong></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ue5f30585\" id=\"ue5f30585\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1228ecff\" id=\"u1228ecff\">生成 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7cdb757f\" id=\"u7cdb757f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u135d6151\" id=\"u135d6151\">merged_firmware.bin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u547b43f9\" id=\"u547b43f9\"> 后，可以直接使用以下命令将其烧录到设备中：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20-m%20esptool%20--chip%20esp32s3%20-b%20460800%20--before%20default_reset%20--after%20hard_reset%20write_flash%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--flash_mode%20dio%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--flash_size%2016MB%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--flash_freq%2080m%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%200x0%20merged_firmware.bin%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GX3vT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22j1aBc%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"Nhk9j\" id=\"Nhk9j\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf40481b8\" id=\"uf40481b8\">注意事项</span></strong></h3><ol list=\"u84ed55e4\"><li fid=\"uc748a19d\" data-lake-id=\"u1d2f6296\" id=\"u1d2f6296\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ube95a419\" id=\"ube95a419\">文件路径</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf61feb12\" id=\"uf61feb12\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u02d4fc88\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6463c668\" data-lake-id=\"u573fd45b\" id=\"u573fd45b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81f916d2\" id=\"u81f916d2\">确保所有输入文件路径正确无误。</span></li><li fid=\"u6463c668\" data-lake-id=\"u04a53411\" id=\"u04a53411\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b10dcb0\" id=\"u3b10dcb0\">如果路径中包含空格，请用引号括起来，例如：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u374b1dbe\" id=\"u374b1dbe\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub07b3da7\" id=\"ub07b3da7\">&quot;build\\partition table\\partition-table.bin&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc3adbf3e\" id=\"uc3adbf3e\">。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u84ed55e4\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uc748a19d\" data-lake-id=\"ua9727165\" id=\"ua9727165\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc47ccc0d\" id=\"uc47ccc0d\">地址对齐</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6c9629ca\" id=\"u6c9629ca\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u211794b0\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u0e0fa274\" data-lake-id=\"u8d3e9a03\" id=\"u8d3e9a03\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0847e17\" id=\"uc0847e17\">确保每个文件的地址与原始烧录命令一致，否则可能导致烧录失败或运行异常。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u84ed55e4\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uc748a19d\" data-lake-id=\"ua8450d78\" id=\"ua8450d78\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u987523fc\" id=\"u987523fc\">Flash 配置</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u89aa0a5f\" id=\"u89aa0a5f\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u3296b506\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ucc3255a1\" data-lake-id=\"ua1a57368\" id=\"ua1a57368\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ba70972\" id=\"u5ba70972\">合并时的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u8d20e071\" id=\"u8d20e071\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0391d03b\" id=\"u0391d03b\">--flash_mode</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucb8d73ec\" id=\"ucb8d73ec\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud86c0c17\" id=\"ud86c0c17\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3b8ce85\" id=\"ue3b8ce85\">--flash_size</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue7ff1ac6\" id=\"ue7ff1ac6\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u26ea72fc\" id=\"u26ea72fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u941a7721\" id=\"u941a7721\">--flash_freq</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9b0a79d1\" id=\"u9b0a79d1\"> 参数应与烧录命令保持一致。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u84ed55e4\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"uc748a19d\" data-lake-id=\"uf2748304\" id=\"uf2748304\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u702b85e0\" id=\"u702b85e0\">OTA 分区</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uda34b084\" id=\"uda34b084\">:</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u76338928\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u51edf0a5\" data-lake-id=\"u9bd20284\" id=\"u9bd20284\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb05ee81\" id=\"ueb05ee81\">如果项目中有 OTA（Over-The-Air）更新功能，请确保 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u0c0fb07c\" id=\"u0c0fb07c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41aab752\" id=\"u41aab752\">ota_data_initial.bin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9c765328\" id=\"u9c765328\"> 文件正确包含在合并过程中。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NW8A7%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u91c8bea9\" id=\"u91c8bea9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5145aafa\" id=\"u5145aafa\">通过上述方法，你可以将多个 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7e83b59b\" id=\"u7e83b59b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u689dea0d\" id=\"u689dea0d\">.bin</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8aaaeb2b\" id=\"u8aaaeb2b\"> 文件合并成一个单一的文件，从而简化烧录流程，特别适合需要批量生产的场景。</span></p>",
